Subject: [PATCH] mprapi: user info, credentials, domain, server install and
 IP-in-IP names (3286)

The mprapi functions that were stubs returning ERROR_CALL_NOT_IMPLEMENTED get their signatures and the answers a machine without the router service gives (RPC_S_SERVER_UNAVAILABLE, argument and level checks); the IP-in-IP interface friendly names are kept in the registry; domain calls answer ERROR_NO_SUCH_DOMAIN.

